          "symbol": "ResidualBlock.forward",
          "expression": "def forward(self, x):\n    shortcut = x\n    out = self.conv_1(x)\n    out = self.conv_1_bn(out)\n    out = F.relu(out)\n    out = self.conv_2(out)\n    out = self.conv_2_bn(out)\n    shortcut = self.conv_shortcut_1(shortcut)\n    shortcut = self.conv_shortcut_1_bn(shortcut)\n    out += shortcut\n    out = F.relu(out)\n    return out"
        }
      ],
